1
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:21,000
Family, food and love. Life's three courses made easy.

2
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
Table Manners is a comedy, drama film directed by Leli Maki.

3
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Housewife Megan's idyllic life is thrown into turmoil, when it emerges that her
husband, Lloyd, faces a heavy prison sentence for tax evasion.

4
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Megan, caught completely unawares is sent into a tailspin as she, not only loses her husband, her home and her
comfortable suburban life, but also finds herself implicated in the tax fraud and facing jail time.

5
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Down on her luck and with nothing to her name Megan
has to rediscover who she really is.

6
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
With the help of her son and her best friend, Lindiwe, she finds solace
and hope in her life-long love and affinity for cooking.

7
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:51,000
She learns that the path back home begins with realizing that she is
enough and all she needs is her family, food and love.

8
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Life's 3 courses made easy.

9
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:21,000
Megan, played by Diaan Lawrenson.

10
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
Lindiwe, played by Renate Stuurman.

11
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Lloyd, played by Neels Van Jaarsveld.

12
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Kgotso, played by Thabo Malema.

13
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
Calculus, played by John Lata.

14
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
Annette, played by Fiona Ramsay.

15
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
Diana Cooper, Viscountess Norwich (née Lady Diana Olivia Winifred Maud Manners; 29 August 1892 – 16 June 1986) was an
English silent film actress and aristocrat who was a well-known social figure in London and Paris.

16
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
As a young woman, she moved in a celebrated group of intellectuals known as
the Coterie, most of whom were killed in the First World War.

17
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:21,000
She married one of the few survivors, Duff Cooper,
later British ambassador to France.

18
01:34:30,000 --> 01:34:36,000
After his death, she wrote three volumes of memoirs which reveal
much about early 20th-century upper-class life.

19
01:39:45,000 --> 01:39:51,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
